= Royal Assent: the Employment Act

The Employment Act [+ year +] receives Royal Assent. Pickets must now stay at their own place of work, new closed shops need the support of four workers in five in a secret ballot, and public money pays for postal ballots.[? if bill_employment1_tough = 1 : The amendments from the right mean that unions can now be sued for damages from secondary action. ?]

#################### Employment Bill

