= Royal Assent: the Trade Union Act

The Trade Union Act [+ year +] receives Royal Assent. From now on, no ballot means no immunity. Moderates expect to win more union elections; the militants expect to win more strike ballots. Both are about to find out.

#################### Housing Bill

@second_housing
title: Second Reading: the Housing Bill
