= In Committee: the British Nationality Bill

Wets on the committee want any child born here who lives here for their first ten years to have the right to register as a British citizen, whatever their parents' status.

- @amend_yes_nationality: Accept the amendment.
- @amend_no_nationality: Reject it.

@amend_yes_nationality
subtitle: The wets are soothed. The right is not.
on-arrival: wet_dissent -= 3; right_dissent += 2; bill_nationality = 3; bill_nationality_amend = 2; bill_nationality_due = time + 1

The ten-year rule goes into the bill. The Home Office calculates that it will affect a few hundred children a year.

@amend_no_nationality
subtitle: The wets dig in.
on-arrival: wet_dissent += 3; right_dissent -= 1; rebellion += 0.3; bill_nationality = 3; bill_nationality_amend = 2; bill_nationality_due = time + 1

