= The Lords Amend the British Nationality Bill

The House of Lords votes to give the people of Gibraltar full British citizenship, against the government's advice. The Foreign Office warns that Spain is watching, and that Hong Kong will ask why the Rock deserves what it does not.

- @lords_yes_nationality: Accept the Lords amendment.
- @lords_no_nationality: Overturn it in the Commons.

@lords_yes_nationality
subtitle: The right is pleased. Madrid is not.
