= Royal Assent: the Rates Act

The Rates Act [+ year +] receives Royal Assent. For the first time, Whitehall can tell an elected council how much it may raise. Ratepayers in the overspending boroughs cheer; the councils in Liverpool and Lambeth start planning a budget they cannot legally set.

