= Royal Assent: the Local Government Act

The Local Government Act [+ year +] receives Royal Assent. The Greater London Council and the metropolitan counties will be gone within two years.[? if bill_glc_watered = 1 : A smaller elected authority will look after London's roads and planning. ?] Across the river, the unemployment figures on the roof of County Hall are updated as usual.

#################### Police and Criminal Evidence Bill

@second_pace
title: Second Reading: the Police and Criminal Evidence Bill
