= Royal Assent: the Police and Criminal Evidence Act

The Police and Criminal Evidence Act [+ year +] receives Royal Assent. For the first time, the powers of the police and the rights of suspects are written down in one place, with codes of practice for every stage from the stop in the street to the cell door.

#################### Telecommunications Bill

@second_telecoms
